          "say": "After one year, you earn seven hundred dollars. Now you have ten thousand seven hundred."
        },
        {
          "say": "In year two, you don't earn seven percent of ten thousand. You earn seven percent of ten thousand seven hundred. That's seven hundred and forty-nine dollars.",
