        {
          "say": "So how does compound interest really work? Three things.",
          "show": {
            "type": "number",
            "big": "$24K > $72K",
            "caption": "Alex vs Sam at 65, same rate",
            "color": "green"
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "One: interest earns interest, so growth is slow at first and enormous at the end. Two: the rule of seventy-two – seventy-two divided by the rate tells you roughly how long it takes to double."
        },
